# Forest Intelligence — Festag dark mode

Canonical source: `lib/design-tokens/dark.ts` → applied in `app/globals.css` `[data-theme="dark"]`.

## Ladder

| Layer | Token | Value |
|---|---|---|
| Canvas | `--festag-black-canvas` | `#0B0F0D` |
| Content | `--festag-black-content` | `#111816` |
| Card / Raised | `--festag-black-raised` | `#161F1C` |
| Elevated / Popup | `--festag-black-popup` | `#1A2521` |
| Hover | `--hover` | `#202D28` |
| Ink | `--festag-night-ink` | `#F5F8F6` |
| Secondary | `--festag-night-ink-2` | `#C7D0CC` |
| Muted | `--festag-night-ink-3` | `#8B9893` |
| Primary (brand) | `--festag-primary` | `#5B647D` |

## Rules

1. Brand accent is Festag slate `#5B647D` — never electric / neon blue (`#295CFF`, `#007AFF`, etc.).
2. Soft forest ink (`#F5F8F6`) — not pure white body text.
3. Primary CTAs = solid slate fill, soft ink text, **no glow / no colored shadow / no gradient**.
4. Quiet hairlines (`--festag-night-line` ~6% white).
5. Calm semantics (`#2FA56E` / `#D6A34F` / `#D86060`).
6. Cards radius `20px`, buttons `14px`, motion `220ms ease-out`.
7. Input focus = slate stroke only — no blue glow ring.
8. Selected nav = soft slate wash (`rgba(91,100,125,0.32)`), not neon fill.

## Do not

- Reintroduce neon / saturated blues
- Colored glow shadows on CTAs
- Pure `#000000` canvas or pure `#FFFFFF` body text in dark
- Fork a second color ladder in auth/Tagro/popup
